; Regression test for issue #3327: a commodity bought at other than the
; day's market price is measured from its cost.
;
; The 10 ABC cost $100, but the day's price, recorded after the purchase,
; makes them worth $120.  A report valued at its terminus books the $20 as
; an unrealized gain, which 3.4.1 did not.  --historical, which values
; each posting at the price of its own day, keeps the revaluations it made
; before, and does not book the $20.

2024/01/02 Buy
    Assets:Broker    10 ABC @ $10
    Assets:Cash

P 2024/01/02 ABC $12

test bal -V --unrealized --now 2024/06/01
                 $20  Assets
                $120    Broker
               $-100    Cash
                $-20  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal -H -V --unrealized --now 2024/06/01
                 $20  Assets
                $120    Broker
               $-100    Cash
--------------------
                 $20
end test
